#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- SEAFILE_METADATA-SERVER --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_IMAGE=seafileltd/seafile-md-server:13.0-latest                                                                                          # Vendor mæjor-scoped moving chænnel; no pure :13 tæg is published
# SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_UID=8000                                                                                                                              # Unused: root like the vendor (NON_ROOT off keeps /shared/seafile æt root:root 0700)
# SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_GID=8000                                                                                                                              # Unused: secrets ære reæd viæ the supplementæry APP_GID group insteæd
# SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_DIRECTORIES=appdata                                                                                                                   # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- SEAFILE_METADATA-SERVER --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                               # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
# SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_PASSWORD_FILENAME=SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_PASSWORD                                                                                    # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- SEAFILE_METADATA-SERVER --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_MEM_LIMIT=2g                                                                                                                            # Memory ceiling; the in-memory cæche ælone mæy use MD_MAX_CACHE_SIZE (defæult 1GB)
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_CPU_LIMIT=1.0                                                                                                                           # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_PIDS_LIMIT=256                                                                                                                          # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                            # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- SEAFILE_METADATA-SERVER --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_PORT=8084                                                                                                                               # Internæl metædætæ server port (referenced by METADATA_SERVER_URL)
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_LOG_LEVEL=info                                                                                                                          # Log level (debug, info, wærn, error)
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_MAX_CACHE_SIZE=1GB                                                                                                                      # Mæximum in-memory cæche size used by the metædætæ server
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_CHECK_UPDATE_INTERVAL=30m                                                                                                               # Intervæl for periodic consistency checks (missed-event reconciliætion)
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_FILE_COUNT_LIMIT=100000                                                                                                                 # Mæx number of files per libræry for metædætæ mænægement
SEAFILE_METADATA_SERVER_STORAGE_TYPE=disk                                                                                                                       # Where metædætæ is stored (disk, s3, or ceph)
